    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1080">

                <pb facs="0793" n="677" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg677"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/3886.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Canada to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 27, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I am just in receipt of the following telegram from the Brazilian Minister. This
                    is the first communication received from him: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>According to assurances Minister Foreign Affairs no American killed, in
                            danger, or imprisoned except one at Aguascalientes who was delivered to
                            judicial <pb facs="0794" n="678" xml:id="pg678"/> authority, some proofs
                            having been found of his connivance with revolution.</p>
                        <p>Have been given all assurance of full protection American and foreigners.
                            Departure Americans from here being arranged for to-morrow. With my best
                            compliments.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Brazilian Minister</hi>.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canada</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
